<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <record id="action_report_payment_receipt" model="ir.actions.report">
        <field name="name">Payment Receipt</field>
        <field name="model">crm.lead</field>
        <field name="report_type">qweb-pdf</field>
        <field name="report_name">ccima_crm_reassign.report_payment_receipt_document</field>
        <field name="report_file">ccima_crm_reassign.report_payment_receipt_document</field>
        <field name="print_report_name">'Receipt - %s' % (object.display_name or '')</field>
    </record>

    <template id="report_payment_receipt_document">
    <t t-call="web.html_container">
        <t t-foreach="docs" t-as="o">
            <t t-call="web.basic_layout">
                <t t-set="base_url" t-value="o.get_base_url()"/>

                <main>
                    <style>
                        /* ===== PAGE ===== */
                        .pb-receipt{
                            border:2px solid #1f4e79;
                            padding:16px 18px;
                            width:100%;
                            box-sizing:border-box;
                            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
                            color:#1f2d3d;
                        }

                        /* ===== HEADER ===== */
                        .pb-header{
                            width:100%;
                            border-collapse:collapse;
                        }
                        .pb-header td{vertical-align:top;}
                        .pb-logo{
                            width:120px;
                        }
                        .pb-logo img{width:110px; height:auto; display:block;}
                        .pb-title{
                            text-align:center;
                            padding:0 10px;
                        }
                        .pb-title .t1{
                            font-size:22px;
                            font-weight:800;
                            letter-spacing:.3px;
                            margin-top:6px;
                            white-space:nowrap;
                        }
                        .pb-title .t2{
                            font-size:11px;
                            margin-top:2px;
                        }
                        .pb-client{
                            width:140px;
                            text-align:right;
                            font-size:18px;
                            font-weight:800;
                            padding-top:10px;
                        }

                        /* ===== TOP BOXES ===== */
                        .pb-top{
                            width:100%;
                            border-collapse:separate;
                            border-spacing:10px 10px;
                            margin-top:10px;
                        }
                        .pb-box{
                            background:#cfd8e3;
                            border:1px solid #c0ccda;
                            height:36px;
                            padding:8px 10px;
                            font-size:14px;
                            box-sizing:border-box;
                            white-space:nowrap;
                        }
                        .pb-box.small{
                            width:100%;
                        }

                        /* ===== BIG LABELS LEFT + BIG BOX RIGHT ===== */
                        .pb-lines{
                            width:100%;
                            border-collapse:separate;
                            border-spacing:0 12px;
                            margin-top:6px;
                        }
                        .pb-lines td{vertical-align:top;}
                        .pb-label{
                            width:180px;
                            font-size:28px;
                            font-weight:500;
                            color:#1f2d3d;
                            padding-right:12px;
                            white-space:nowrap;
                        }
                        .pb-big{
                            background:#cfd8e3;
                            border:1px solid #c0ccda;
                            height:54px;
                            width:100%;
                        }
                        .pb-huge{
                            background:#cfd8e3;
                            border:1px solid #c0ccda;
                            height:170px;
                            width:100%;
                        }

                        /* ===== TERMS ===== */
                        .pb-terms{
                            margin-top:14px;
                            font-size:12px;
                        }
                        .pb-terms b{font-weight:800;}
                        .pb-terms ul{margin:6px 0 0 16px; padding:0;}
                        .pb-terms li{margin:3px 0;}

                        /* ===== SIGNATURES ===== */
                        .pb-sign{
                            width:100%;
                            border-collapse:collapse;
                            margin-top:90px;
                        }
                        .pb-sign td{
                            width:50%;
                            text-align:center;
                            padding:0 50px;
                        }
                        .pb-line{
                            border-top:2px solid #2f3e50;
                            margin:0 auto 8px auto;
                            width:100%;
                        }
                        .pb-sign .ttl{
                            font-size:18px;
                            font-weight:700;
                            margin-bottom:2px;
                        }
                        .pb-sign .sub{
                            font-size:18px;
                            line-height:1.2;
                        }

                        /* ===== BOTTOM LOGOS ===== */
                        .pb-bottom{
                            width:100%;
                            border-collapse:collapse;
                            margin-top:36px;
                        }
                        .pb-bottom td{vertical-align:bottom;}
                        .pb-bottom .l img{height:70px; display:block;}
                        .pb-bottom .r img{height:80px; display:block; float:right;}
                    </style>

                    <div class="page">
                        <div class="pb-receipt">

                            <!-- HEADER -->
                            <table class="pb-header">
                                <tr>
                                    <td class="pb-logo">
                                        <img t-att-src="base_url + '/ccima_crm_reassign/static/src/img/logo_portto.png'"/>
                                    </td>
                                    <td class="pb-title">
                                        <div class="t1">RECIBO DE PAGO PORTTO BLANCO CIMATARIO</div>
                                        <div class="t2">Km 17.5, Carretera Federal 57, SANTA ROSA JAUREGUI, 76220 Santiago de Querétaro, Qro.</div>
                                    </td>
                                    <td class="pb-client">Cliente</td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>

                            <!-- TOP BOXES -->
                            <table class="pb-top">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="width:35%;">
                                        <div class="pb-box">Referencia:</div>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="width:35%;">
                                        <div class="pb-box">Método de pago:</div>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="width:30%;">
                                        <div class="pb-box">Folio: HAB-________-PBC</div>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="width:35%;"></td>
                                    <td style="width:35%;"></td>
                                    <td style="width:30%;">
                                        <div class="pb-box">Fecha:</div>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>

                            <!-- BIG LINES -->
                            <table class="pb-lines">
                                <tr>
                                    <td class="pb-label">Recibimos de:</td>
                                    <td><div class="pb-big"></div></td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td class="pb-label">Cantidad de:</td>
                                    <td><div class="pb-big"></div></td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td class="pb-label">Promociones:</td>
                                    <td><div class="pb-huge"></div></td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>

                            <!-- TERMS -->
                            <div class="pb-terms">
                                <b>Términos y Condiciones.</b>
                                <ul>
                                    <li>Válido si paga enganche completo y firma de contrato en un periodo máximo de 10 días hábiles posteriores al apartado.</li>
                                    <li>En caso de cancelación se penalizará por gastos administrativos el monto del apartado.</li>
                                    <li>Cambios sin previo aviso.</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>

                            <!-- SIGNATURES -->
                            <table class="pb-sign">
                                <tr>
                                    <td>
                                        <div class="pb-line"></div>
                                        <div class="ttl">Entrega:</div>
                                        <div class="sub">Nombre y Firma<br/>del Cliente</div>
                                    </td>
                                    <td>
                                        <div class="pb-line"></div>
                                        <div class="ttl">Recibe:</div>
                                        <div class="sub">Nombre y Firma<br/>del Asesor</div>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>

                            <!-- BOTTOM LOGOS -->
                            <table class="pb-bottom">
                                <tr>
                                    <td class="l">
                                        <img t-att-src="base_url + '/ccima_crm_reassign/static/src/img/logo_aliado.png'"/>
                                    </td>
                                    <td class="r">
                                        <img t-att-src="base_url + '/ccima_crm_reassign/static/src/img/logo_ccima.png'"/>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>

                        </div>
                    </div>
                </main>
            </t>
        </t>
    </t>
</template>
</odoo>